    "source_review": [
      "Strict disposable loopback/environment guard; uniquely generated fixture schema/roles; no Garden rows or policies touched",
      "Nonlogin nonowner resolver has only tested metadata-column SELECT and UPDATE(version); no runtime role membership, table write/truncate privilege or schema CREATE after setup",
      "Exact PID/xid/login/actor/purpose/target/revision/expiry context is owned separately; caller-set session settings cannot establish admission",
      "Permissive role-specific policies constrain resolver SELECT/UPDATE to exact context, with false write check; unrelated writer policy cannot apply via membership",
      "Fixed schema-qualified definer helpers; bounded metadata projection; negative payload/owner/whole-row/predicate/retained-content and mutation probes with exact SQLSTATE/message expectations",
      "Negative mutation probes always rollback; row digests verify no effects; actual two-transaction FOR SHARE test observes exact backend blocker before reader release",
      "Finally teardown is bounded to owned synthetic schema and roles; no permission or physical-erasure result inferred for production"
    ],
